cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "GrammarGate: Multi-Plane Runtime Defense Against Constrained Decoding Attacks"
message: "If you use GrammarGate, its evaluation corpus, or cross-plane refusal gating in your research, please cite this software."
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-25"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sidthebuilder/GrammarGate"
url: "https://sidthebuilder.github.io/GrammarGate/"
authors:
