abstract: >-
  GrammarGate is a zero-retraining, three-plane runtime defense protecting structured and
  grammar-constrained LLM decoding (XGrammar) against EnumAttack, CodeSpear, DictAttack, and
  adaptive constrained decoding exploits without sacrificing valid JSON or code utility.
